{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06496","headline":"渔父词 · 储光羲","name":"渔父词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泽鱼好鸣水，溪鱼好上流。\n渔梁不得意，下渚潜垂钩。\n乱荇时碍楫，新芦复隐舟。\n静言念终始，安坐看沈浮。\n素发随风扬，远心与云游。\n逆浪还极浦，信潮下沧洲。\n非爲徇形役，所乐在行休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}